6a6e83dcca0b4b55c402d6804538d0ea43ef37`).\n\nAll six source gates passed through the hosted exact-source workflow. Each of the two complete four-shard families passed 5,673 tests with zero failures, cancellations, skips or TODOs. Production reproduction/readiness and the ordinary build passed on the hosted source. Both hosted source families used Node 20.19.6. No local command gates are claimed by this qualification pipeline; earlier local P03 cohorts remain separately source-scoped corroboration. The full test suite and ordinary build use the actual hosted authority above; no duplicate local execution is claimed.\n\nThe separately authenticated hosted utility inspected the complete frozen original artifact. Its source archive matches all 9,875 tracked files and modes. Every one of the 690 game files matches its original manifest. Local assembly rehashes the retained original metadata and preserves exact runner member descriptors for the source and distribution payloads; it does not download or rehash the large originals locally. The attached evidence preserves the selected original qualification and Settings observations, including retained earlier failures; it does not replace verification of this release after deployment.\n\nPredecessor: [v0.60.5](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/tag/v0.60.5). Before selecting v0.60.6 on main Pages, finish v0.60.5 public acceptance, retain its exact immutable originals on a newly admitted archive with sufficient extracted capacity using the existing original-ZIP route, verify archive inventory/public bytes/play, and preserve all prior allocations, admissions and catalog entries. Archive19 has 173802288 bytes free and v0.60.5 needs at least312958569 extracted bytes, so it cannot fit. Archive20 is the proposed next ID; recheck live availability and bind real source/workflow/deployment identities only after separately authorized creation. This record approves requirements only, not an existing archive, admission or deployment. Complete the normal main publisher PR/merge, deployed byte verification and applicable native play/offline evidence. Source and attachment qualification alone do not establish public P03 acceptance.\n\nAt package assembly, public byte/play/offline verification is pending; acceptance is recorded separately after publication. Full P03/P05 remains incomplete. Modeled input, browser observations and physical-device qualification remain separate evidence categories.\n"}